## Prefix scenario domains with Zz and purge leftovers at campaign start
================================================================================

Context: Campaign domains mixed with real registry entries. Names cannot
contain underscores (CamelCase alphanumeric only), so the ``ZZ_`` prefix
becomes ``Zz``. A new scenario 0 deletes leftover ``Zz*`` / ``ZZ_*``
folders (and the pre-rename ``testscenario1`` / ``testzerocopy`` /
``testmetadataintegrity`` / ``salesdomain`` ones) before the journey
recreates them.

Changes:

1. tests/e2e/scenarios/_harness.py
   Canonical ``Zz*`` domain constants, leftover matcher, and
   ``purge_campaign_domains``.
2. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_00_purge.py
   Campaign preflight: DELETE every leftover campaign domain.
3. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_01_generate_live.py
   Domain ``ZzTestScenario1``; chain depends on scenario 0.
4. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_02_collab_lifecycle.py
   Default folder ``zztestscenario1``.
5. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_03_rules_analysis.py
   Default folder ``zztestscenario1``.
6. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_04_metadata_integrity.py
   Domain ``ZzTestMetadataIntegrity``; chain depends on scenario 0.
7. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_05_zero_copy_entity_features.py
   Domain ``ZzTestZeroCopy``; chain depends on scenario 0.
8. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_scenario_validation.py
   Default folder ``zztestscenario1``.
9. tests/e2e/scenarios/test_full_lifecycle.py
   Domain ``ZzSalesDomain``.
10. tests/e2e/scenarios/README.md
    Document Zz prefix, purge step, and chain on scenario 0.
11. tests/units/e2e/test_scenario_campaign_wiring.py
    Prefix, leftover matcher, and purge-step contracts.

